WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.767 --> 00:00:05.867
From your first sign-in, to your first clock-in.

2
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:13.445
Save your company profile, and Flow opens this by itself.

3
00:00:13.445 --> 00:00:16.767
The quickest way to see it work, is on yourself.

4
00:00:22.233 --> 00:00:24.155
To bring someone in, open People.

5
00:00:24.155 --> 00:00:26.600
The invite sits in the row above the list.

6
00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:31.579
Their email is all you need.

7
00:00:31.579 --> 00:00:36.135
Someone who only clocks in goes on Tracker only, one licence instead of two.

8
00:00:36.135 --> 00:00:37.633
Then press Generate Code.

9
00:00:42.233 --> 00:00:43.166
Six characters.

10
00:00:43.166 --> 00:00:48.267
This screen is the only place you will see them, so send them before you close it.

11
00:00:53.967 --> 00:00:56.981
On the phone, a new worker does not sign in yet.

12
00:00:56.981 --> 00:00:58.300
The code comes first.

13
00:01:01.300 --> 00:01:03.701
They type the six characters you sent.

14
00:01:03.701 --> 00:01:06.733
If the code is good, your company name comes up.

15
00:01:09.633 --> 00:01:14.036
Name, surname, email, and a password they choose themselves.

16
00:01:14.036 --> 00:01:15.284
You never see it.

17
00:01:15.284 --> 00:01:19.467
Then the terms, and the GPS notice, which is signed once.

18
00:01:22.300 --> 00:01:25.021
The switch for the car goes before starting.

19
00:01:25.021 --> 00:01:26.010
Then one button.

20
00:01:26.010 --> 00:01:27.865
Green to start, red to finish.

21
00:01:27.865 --> 00:01:30.833
The app takes the position, and opens the shift.

22
00:01:33.967 --> 00:01:37.507
Every shift keeps where it opened, and where it closed.

23
00:01:37.507 --> 00:01:38.794
Two points on a map.

24
00:01:38.794 --> 00:01:39.567
Not a trail.

25
00:01:43.967 --> 00:01:46.411
Back in the office, it is already there.

26
00:01:46.411 --> 00:01:51.300
Press Enlarge, and the map gives you the address, the time, and the coordinates.

27
00:01:54.967 --> 00:01:57.150
Sign in, invite, clock in.

28
00:01:57.150 --> 00:01:59.333
Try it at geotapp dot com.
